# Ending — Keeping Up Appearances (GDD § 8 "Stay In Doubt": keep all masks up
# forever; visible cracks). Nothing dramatic happens. That's the ending.
# TODO: authenticity check — ending draft.

Five years later.
You haven't missed a meeting in three of them. You comment at the Lighthouse Study: short answers, straight from the paragraph. Nobody could fault them.
At night you read things on your phone with the brightness turned all the way down.
{GameState.parent_word} says you seem settled. You say you are.
In the territory you knock, you smile, you offer the magazine. When a door closes you feel something you don't have a name for, and it isn't disappointment.
You know exactly what you'd lose. You count it every morning. Then you put on the good shirt.
